0,Geoffrey Gurrumul Yunupingu - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geoffrey_Gurrumul_Yunupingu,"The Australian Music Prize (AMP) is an annual award of $30,000 given to an Australian band or solo artist in recognition of the merit of an album released during the year of award. The award commenced in 2005.",Gumatj,Australian
1,Galarrwuy Yunupingu - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Galarrwuy_Yunupingu,"Galarrwuy Yunupingu (30 June 1948 – 3 April 2023), also known as James Galarrwuy Yunupingu and Dr Yunupingu, was an Indigenous Australian activist who was a leader in the Aboriginal Australian community. He was involved in Indigenous land rights throughout his career. He was a Yolngu man of the Gumatj clan, from Arnhem Land in the Northern Territory. He was the 1978 Australian of the Year.",Gumatj,Australian
